 r←Test_TableEdit_036(stopFlag batchFlag);parms;n;⎕TRAP;table;rowTitles
⍝ Test whether the menubar can be suppressed altogether.
 r←T._Inactive
 :Return

 r←T._Failed
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')

 table←⍪'Obama' 'Bush' 'Clinton' 'Reagan' 'Kennedy'
 table,←'Barak' 'George' 'Bill' 'Ronald' 'John'
 table,←?5 200⍴1000000
 parms←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.Table.CreateParms
 parms.posn←35 25
 parms.size←400 600
 parms.caption←'Test_Table_005: suppress menubar'
 parms.confirmQuit←0
 parms.testMode←1
 parms.menubar←''

 n←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.Table.Create table #.APLGUI.APLGUI.APLGuiGlobalParms.CreateDefaults parms

 r←~0∊⍴'Menubar'⎕WN n.∆Form

∆TidyUp:
 n.∆CloseForm
